From 5ec1e59dcf30ad9afd577816ba482ecc31adb932 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:54:17 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Embassy doctrines, patrons and Broker the Compact (building
 slice 10)

- CourtState: a list of sworn Patrons (legacy single patron migrates on
  load) and CompactBrokered.
- Patron slots: one per Embassy tier (3 at T3), +1 under Patronage; one
  seat per court, two under Patronage. Every seated Patron puts their
  card in the kingdom's parley deck.
- Broker the Compact: automated Embassy III mission (Trusted, 3 moons,
  300 gold). Seals a treaty for the timeline and Unites an archmage's
  Seat when corruption is within the Unite limit.
- Concordat: courts under the Compact send soldiers to Hold the Line
  postings (+3 a moon each, cap 6), never against themselves.
- embassy.json: both doctrines, dead text removed.
- CouncilSaveAssert: patron list, compact, legacy migration.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RF7HNp6pvyXiAz229q52Px
